nav: "maschinen"
navSolid: true
langDE: "/maschinen.html"
langEN: "/en/maschinen.html"

titleDE: "Grabenfräsen Maschinenpark — LIBA Lingener Baumaschinen | bis 4.500 mm Frästiefe"
titleEN: "Trench Cutter Range — LIBA Lingener Baumaschinen | up to 4,500 mm cutting depth"
descDE: "LIBA Grabenfräsen: Anbaufräsen für Bagger (bis 1.400 mm Frästiefe), Schlepperanbau (bis 1.800 mm), Selbstfahrer, Tiefenfräsen bis 4.500 mm. 30 Modelle — Made in Germany seit 1969."
descEN: "LIBA trench cutters: excavator-mounted cutters (up to 1,400 mm), tractor-mounted (up to 1,800 mm), self-propelled, deep-cut machines up to 4,500 mm. 30 models — Made in Germany since 1969."
canonicalDE: "https://lingener-baumaschinen.de/maschinen.html"
canonicalEN: "https://lingener-baumaschinen.de/en/maschinen.html"
ogTitleDE: "Maschinenpark — LIBA Lingener Baumaschinen"
ogTitleEN: "Machine Range — LIBA Lingener Baumaschinen"
ogDescDE: "Fünf Produktfamilien, 30 Modelle. Anbaufräsen für Bagger und Traktoren, Selbstfahrer, Spezialmaschinen und Pflüge — Made in Germany."
ogDescEN: "Five product families, 30 models. Excavator and tractor-mounted cutters, self-propelled machines, specialist machines and ploughs — Made in Germany."
schemaDE: >-
  {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Kann ich bei Lingener Baumaschinen eine Grabenfräse mieten?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ja. Lingener Baumaschinen bietet Grabenfräsen zur Miete an. Verfügbar sind unter anderem die GM 4 Allrad, GM 4 Raupe und GM 6 ASR. Die Mietgeräte eignen sich für kurzfristige Projekte, bei denen ein Kauf nicht wirtschaftlich wäre. Eine Mietanfrage können Sie direkt über die Website stellen."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Welche Grabenfräsen gibt es für den Baggeranbau?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Lingener Baumaschinen bietet folgende Grabenfräsen als Baggeranbaufräsen an: GM 140 AFH-500, GM 140 AFH-600 und GM 140 H. Diese Anbaufräsen werden an handelsübliche Bagger montiert und ermöglichen präzise Fräsarbeiten auch in schwer zugänglichem Gelände."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Welche Grabenfräsen sind für Traktoren und Schlepper geeignet?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Als Traktorfräse oder Schlepperanbaufräse eignen sich bei Lingener Baumaschinen folgende Modelle: GM 1 AF, GM 1 AS, GM 140 AF, GM 140 AS, GM 140 AFH-600 H, GM 160 AS, GM 160 AF, GM 180 AF und GM 600 R. Die Wahl des richtigen Modells hängt von der gewünschten Grabentiefe, -breite und dem verfügbaren Trägerfahrzeug ab."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Wie tief kann eine Grabenfräse fräsen?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Die Frästiefe hängt vom Modell ab. Standardgrabenfräsen erreichen Tiefen von 40–80 cm. Tiefenfräsen wie die GM 300 H, GM 300 HF und GM 450 H ermöglichen Arbeiten bis zu mehreren Metern Tiefe — die GM 450 H erreicht bis zu 4.500 mm Frästiefe."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Kann eine Grabenfräse auch in hartem Boden oder Fels eingesetzt werden?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ja. Die Grabenfräse GM 6 ASR von Lingener Baumaschinen ist speziell für extrem harten Boden und steiniges Gelände entwickelt worden. Sie bewährt sich im Fels-, Stein- und Bergbaubereich und wird weltweit für anspruchsvollste Böden eingesetzt."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Sind bei Lingener Baumaschinen auch Gebraucht-Grabenfräsen erhältlich?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ja, Lingener Baumaschinen bietet neben Neumaschinen auch gebrauchte Grabenfräsen sowie Ersatzteile und Zubehör an. Das aktuelle Angebot an Gebrauchtmaschinen finden Sie im entsprechenden Bereich der Website."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"In welchen Ländern sind Grabenfräsen von Lingener Baumaschinen erhältlich?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Lingener Baumaschinen ist seit 1969 tätig und verfügt über ein weltweites Händlernetz. Die Maschinen werden in nahezu alle Teile der Welt geliefert. Den passenden Ansprechpartner für Ihr Land nennen wir Ihnen auf Anfrage über das Kontaktformular oder telefonisch."}}]}
schemaEN: >-
  {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I hire a trench cutter from Lingener Baumaschinen?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Lingener Baumaschinen offers trench cutters for hire. Available models include the GM 4 All-Wheel, GM 4 Crawler and GM 6 ASR. Hire machines are suitable for short-term projects where purchasing would not be economical. You can submit a hire enquiry directly via the website."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which trench cutters are available for excavator attachment?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Lingener Baumaschinen offers the following trench cutters as excavator attachments: GM 140 AFH-500, GM 140 AFH-600 and GM 140 H. These attachment cutters are mounted on standard excavators and enable precise trenching even in difficult terrain."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which trench cutters are suitable for tractors?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As tractor-mounted trench cutters, Lingener Baumaschinen offers the following models: GM 1 AF, GM 1 AS, GM 140 AF, GM 140 AS, GM 140 AFH-600 H, GM 160 AS, GM 160 AF, GM 180 AF and GM 600 R. The choice of the right model depends on the required trench depth, width and the available carrier machine."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How deep can a trench cutter cut?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Cutting depth depends on the model. Standard trench cutters reach depths of 40–80 cm. Deep-cut machines such as the GM 300 H, GM 300 HF and GM 450 H enable work to depths of several metres — the GM 450 H reaches up to 4,500 mm."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a trench cutter be used in hard ground or rock?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The GM 6 ASR trench cutter from Lingener Baumaschinen was developed specifically for extremely hard ground and rocky terrain. It performs reliably in rock, stone and mining environments and is deployed worldwide for the most demanding ground conditions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are used trench cutters available from Lingener Baumaschinen?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Lingener Baumaschinen offers used trench cutters in addition to new machines, along with spare parts and accessories. The current stock of used machines can be found in the corresponding section of the website."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"In which countries are Lingener Baumaschinen trench cutters available?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Lingener Baumaschinen has been operating since 1969 and has a worldwide dealer network. The machines are delivered to almost every part of the world. We will name the right contact for your country on request via the contact form or by phone."}}]}

eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ titleDE if lang == 'de' else titleEN }}"
  description: "{{ descDE if lang == 'de' else descEN }}"
  canonical: "{{ canonicalDE if lang == 'de' else canonicalEN }}"
  ogTitle: "{{ ogTitleDE if lang == 'de' else ogTitleEN }}"
  ogDescription: "{{ ogDescDE if lang == 'de' else ogDescEN }}"
  ogLocale: "{{ 'de_DE' if lang == 'de' else 'en_GB' }}"
  schema: "{{ (schemaDE if lang == 'de' else schemaEN) | safe }}"
---

{# Basis-Pfad für Modell-Links in den Kategorie-Listen (DE/EN) #}
{% set mBase = '/en/maschinen/' if lang == 'en' else '/maschinen/' %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/products/gm-180-af-bg.webp');" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/index.html{% else %}/en/index.html{% endif %}">{% if lang == "de" %}Start{% else %}Home{% endif %}</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>{% if lang == "de" %}Maschinenpark{% else %}Machine Range{% endif %}</span></div>
    <span class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>{% if lang == "de" %}Produktportfolio{% else %}Product Portfolio{% endif %}</span>
    <h1 data-split-lines class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Der LIBA <em class="serif-italic">Maschinenpark.</em>{% else %}The LIBA <em class="serif-italic">Machine Range.</em>{% endif %}</h1>
    <p>{% if lang == "de" %}30 Grabenfräsen-Modelle — von der Baggeranbau-Fräse mit 200 mm Frästiefe bis zur Tiefenfräse mit 4.500 mm. Jede Maschine ist auf Trägergerät, Untergrund und Einsatzszenario hin entwickelt: kompromisslos auf Effizienz im Graben getrimmt. Made in Germany seit 1969.{% else %}30 trench cutter models — from excavator-mounted cutters with 200 mm cutting depth to deep-cut machines with 4,500 mm. Every machine is developed for its carrier, ground type and application: uncompromisingly optimised for trench efficiency. Made in Germany since 1969.{% endif %}</p>
    <div class="hero-actions mt-4">
      <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/assets/pdfs/LIBA-Broschuere.pdf?v=2026{% else %}/assets/pdfs/LIBA-Brochure.pdf?v=2026{% endif %}" class="btn btn-outline-light" download>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16" style="margin-right:.35rem;"><path d="M12 15V3m0 12l-4-4m4 4l4-4"/><path d="M2 17l.621 2.485A2 2 0 004.561 21h14.878a2 2 0 001.94-1.515L22 17"/></svg>
        {% if lang == "de" %}Gesamtkatalog herunterladen{% else %}Download full catalogue{% endif %}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">

    <!-- {% if lang == "de" %}Maschinenberater{% else %}Machine Adviser{% endif %} — inline card -->
    <div class="wizard-inline reveal" id="maschinenwizard" style="margin-bottom:3.5rem;"
      data-kontakt="{{ ('/kontakt.html' if lang == 'de' else '/en/kontakt.html') | url }}"
      data-masch="{{ ('/maschinen/' if lang == 'de' else '/en/maschinen/') | url }}">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.75rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
        <div>
          <span style="font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand-light);display:block;margin-bottom:.25rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Entscheidungshilfe{% else %}Decision Guide{% endif %}</span>
          <p style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--canvas);margin:0;">{% if lang == "de" %}Welche Fräse passt zu Ihrem Projekt? — Zwei Fragen, direkte Empfehlung.{% else %}Which cutter suits your project? — Two questions, direct recommendation.{% endif %}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="wizard-progress" id="wizard-progress" style="flex-shrink:0;">
          <div class="wizard-pdot is-active"></div>
          <div class="wizard-pdot"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="wizard-viewport" id="wizard-viewport">
        <div class="wizard-track" id="wizard-track">
          <!-- {% if lang == "de" %}Schritt 1{% else %}Step 1{% endif %} -->
          <div class="wizard-pane" id="wstep-1">
            <p class="wizard-hint" style="margin-bottom:.75rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Welches Trägergerät haben Sie?{% else %}Which carrier machine do you have?{% endif %}</p>
            <div class="wizard-opts">
              <button class="wizard-opt" data-key="bagger" type="button">
                <span class="wizard-opt-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" width="20" height="20"><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="6" rx="1"/><path d="M6 14V9l4-5h8v10"/><path d="M14 9H9"/></svg></span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-title">{% if lang == "de" %}Bagger{% else %}Excavator{% endif %}</span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Mobil- oder Kettenbagger ab 6 t{% else %}Wheeled or tracked excavator from 6 t{% endif %}</span>
              </button>
              <button class="wizard-opt" data-key="traktor" type="button">
                <span class="wizard-opt-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" width="20" height="20"><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="3"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"/><path d="M10 17h5V9l-3-4H4v12h3"/></svg></span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-title">{% if lang == "de" %}Traktor / Schlepper{% else %}Tractor{% endif %}</span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Heck- oder Frontanbau{% else %}Rear or front attachment{% endif %}</span>
              </button>
              <button class="wizard-opt" data-key="self" type="button">
                <span class="wizard-opt-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" width="20" height="20"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="9" rx="2"/><circle cx="8" cy="17" r="2"/><circle cx="16" cy="17" r="2"/><path d="M8 8V5h8v3"/></svg></span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-title">{% if lang == "de" %}Kein (Selbstfahrer){% else %}None (Self-propelled){% endif %}</span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Eigenständige Maschine{% else %}Independent machine{% endif %}</span>
              </button>
              <button class="wizard-opt" data-key="tiefe" type="button">
                <span class="wizard-opt-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" width="20" height="20"><path d="M12 5v14M19 12l-7 7-7-7"/></svg></span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-title">{% if lang == "de" %}Tiefenfräse{% else %}Deep-cut machine{% endif %}</span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Frästiefe &gt; 1.500 mm{% else %}Cutting depth &gt; 1,500 mm{% endif %}</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- {% if lang == "de" %}Schritt 2{% else %}Step 2{% endif %} -->
          <div class="wizard-pane" id="wstep-2">
            <button class="wizard-back" id="wizard-back" type="button">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="13" height="13"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg> {% if lang == "de" %}Zurück{% else %}Back{% endif %}
            </button>
            <p class="wizard-hint" style="margin-bottom:.75rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Welche maximale Frästiefe brauchen Sie?{% else %}What maximum cutting depth do you need?{% endif %}</p>
            <div class="wizard-opts">
              <button class="wizard-opt" data-key="s" type="button">
                <span class="wizard-opt-title">{% if lang == "de" %}bis 600 mm{% else %}up to 600 mm{% endif %}</span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Glasfaser, Erdkabel, Kleinrohr{% else %}Fibre optic, earth cables, small pipes{% endif %}</span>
              </button>
              <button class="wizard-opt" data-key="m" type="button">
                <span class="wizard-opt-title">{% if lang == "de" %}bis 1.200 mm{% else %}up to 1,200 mm{% endif %}</span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Pipeline DN 100–200, Drainage{% else %}Pipeline DN 100–200, drainage{% endif %}</span>
              </button>
              <button class="wizard-opt" data-key="d" type="button">
                <span class="wizard-opt-title">{% if lang == "de" %}bis 2.000 mm{% else %}up to 2,000 mm{% endif %}</span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Pipeline DN 300, Fernwärme{% else %}Pipeline DN 300, district heating{% endif %}</span>
              </button>
              <button class="wizard-opt" data-key="x" type="button">
                <span class="wizard-opt-title">{% if lang == "de" %}über 2.000 mm{% else %}over 2,000 mm{% endif %}</span>
                <span class="wizard-opt-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Sondertiefbau, Großrohr{% else %}Special deep construction, large-bore pipe{% endif %}</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- {% if lang == "de" %}Ergebnis{% else %}Result{% endif %} -->
          <div class="wizard-pane" id="wizard-result">
            <button class="wizard-back" id="wizard-back-result" type="button">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="13" height="13"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg> {% if lang == "de" %}Neue Auswahl{% else %}New selection{% endif %}
            </button>
            <p class="wizard-hint" style="margin-bottom:.75rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Empfehlung für Ihr Projekt{% else %}Recommendation for your project{% endif %}</p>
            <div class="wizard-rcards" id="wizard-cards"></div>
            <button class="wizard-restart" type="button">↺ {% if lang == "de" %}Von vorne beginnen{% else %}Start again{% endif %}</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="divider">

    <!-- Maschinenübersicht — alle 30 Maschinen als Karten -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <div class="reveal" style="display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem; margin-bottom:1.75rem;">
        <div>
          <span class="section-index">{% if lang == "de" %}00 / Maschinenübersicht{% else %}00 / All Machines{% endif %}</span>
          <h2 class="mt-2">{% if lang == "de" %}Alle 30 Maschinen<br><em class="serif-italic">im Überblick.</em>{% else %}All 30 Machines<br><em class="serif-italic">at a glance.</em>{% endif %}</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="maschinen-filter" role="group" aria-label="{% if lang == 'de' %}Maschinen nach Kategorie filtern{% else %}Filter machines by category{% endif %}" id="mf-tabs">
          <button class="mf-tab is-active" data-filter="all" type="button" aria-pressed="true">{% if lang == "de" %}Alle (30){% else %}All (30){% endif %}</button>
          <button class="mf-tab" data-filter="Selbstfahrer" type="button" aria-pressed="false">{% if lang == "de" %}Selbstfahrer (7){% else %}Self-Propelled (7){% endif %}</button>
          <button class="mf-tab" data-filter="Schlepperanbau" type="button" aria-pressed="false">{% if lang == "de" %}Schlepperanbau (18){% else %}Tractor-Mounted (18){% endif %}</button>
          <button class="mf-tab" data-filter="Baggeranbau" type="button" aria-pressed="false">{% if lang == "de" %}Baggeranbau (5){% else %}Excavator-Mounted (5){% endif %}</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="maschinen-grid" id="maschinen-grid">
        {% for m in maschinen %}
        <a href="{% if lang == 'de' %}/maschinen/{{ m.slug }}.html{% else %}/en/maschinen/{{ m.slug }}.html{% endif %}"
           class="maschine-card"
           data-category="{{ m.category }}">
          <div class="maschine-card-img">
            <img loading="lazy" src="{{ m.heroImage }}"
                 alt="{% if lang == 'de' %}{{ m.heroAltDE }}{% else %}{{ m.heroAltEN }}{% endif %}">
          </div>
          <div class="maschine-card-body">
            <span class="maschine-card-cat">{{ labels.cat(m.category, lang) }}</span>
            <p class="maschine-card-name">{{ m.nameEN if lang == 'en' and m.nameEN else m.name }}</p>
            <p class="maschine-card-sub">{% if lang == "de" %}{{ m.subtitleDE }}{% else %}{{ m.subtitleEN }}{% endif %}</p>
            <span class="maschine-card-badge {% if m.condition == 'Neu' %}badge-neu{% elif m.condition == 'Gebraucht' %}badge-gebraucht{% else %}badge-vorfuehrmaschine{% endif %}">
              {% if lang == "de" %}{{ m.condition }}{% if m.year %} {{ m.year }}{% endif %}{% else %}{% if m.condition == 'Neu' %}New{% elif m.condition == 'Gebraucht' %}Used{% else %}Demo{% endif %}{% if m.year %} {{ m.year }}{% endif %}{% endif %}
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab-Filter-Logik liegt in /assets/js/main.js (CSP ohne 'unsafe-inline') -->

    <hr class="divider">

    <div id="anbau-bagger" class="split align-start reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-index">{% if lang == "de" %}01 / Anbaufräsen Bagger{% else %}01 / Excavator-Mounted Cutters{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Grabenfräsen für Bagger —<br><em class="serif-italic">bis 1.400 mm Frästiefe</em>{% else %}Trench Cutters for Excavators —<br><em class="serif-italic">up to 1,400 mm cutting depth</em>{% endif %}</h2>
        <p class="lead mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Die LIBA Baggeranbau-Grabenfräsen GM 140 H, GM 140 AFH-500 und GM 140 AFH-600 sind hydraulisch angetriebene Kettenfräsen für Mobil- und Kettenbagger ab 6 t. Frästiefen von 200 bis 1.400 mm, Fräsbreiten von 60 bis 400 mm — für Kabel-, Rohrleitungs- und Leitungsbau.{% else %}The LIBA excavator-mounted trench cutters GM 140 H, GM 140 AFH-500 and GM 140 AFH-600 are hydraulically driven chain cutters for wheeled and tracked excavators from 6 t. Cutting depths from 200 to 1,400 mm, cutting widths from 60 to 400 mm — for cable, pipeline and utility installation.{% endif %}</p>
        <ul class="spec-list is-kerf">
          <li><strong><a class="spec-link is-stretched" href="{{ mBase }}gm-140-h.html">GM 140 H</a></strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Grabenfräse für Bagger ab 6 t. Frästiefe bis 900 mm, Fräsbreite 60–350 mm. Kompakt für Erdkabel und kommunalen Tiefbau.{% else %}Trench cutter for excavators from 6 t. Cutting depth up to 900 mm, cutting width 60–350 mm. Compact for earth cables and municipal civil engineering.{% endif %}</span></li>
          <li><strong><a class="spec-link is-stretched" href="{{ mBase }}gm-140-afh-500.html">GM 140 AFH-500</a></strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Mittlere Klasse für Rohrleitungs- und Kabelbau. Frästiefe bis 500 mm, Trägergerät ab 8 t.{% else %}Mid-range model for pipeline and cable installation. Cutting depth up to 500 mm, carrier machine from 8 t.{% endif %}</span></li>
          <li><strong><a class="spec-link is-stretched" href="{{ mBase }}gm-140-afh-600.html">GM 140 AFH-600</a></strong><span class="spec-desc">{% if lang == "de" %}Erhöhte Frästiefe bis 600 mm für Pipeline-Verlegung DN 100–DN 200, Trägergerät ab 12 t.{% else %}Increased cutting depth up to 600 mm for pipeline installation DN 100–DN 200, carrier machine from 12 t.{% endif %}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="spec-stats">
          <div class="spec-stat"><span class="spec-stat-val">{% if lang == "de" %}1.400{% else %}1,400{% endif %}<span style="font-size:.6em;font-weight:400;"> mm</span></span><span class="spec-stat-key">{% if lang == "de" %}Frästiefe max.{% else %}Max. cutting depth{% endif %}</span></div>
          <div class="spec-stat"><span class="spec-stat-val">60–400<span style="font-size:.6em;font-weight:400;"> mm</span></span><span class="spec-stat-key">{% if lang == "de" %}Fräsbreite{% else %}Cutting width{% endif %}</span></div>
          <div class="spec-stat"><span class="spec-stat-val">{% if lang == "de" %}ab 6{% else %}from 6{% endif %}<span style="font-size:.6em;font-weight:400;"> t</span></span><span class="spec-stat-key">{% if lang == "de" %}Trägergerät{% else %}Carrier machine{% endif %}</span></div>
        </div>
        <table class="spec-table">
          <tbody>
            <tr><th>{% if lang == "de" %}Frästiefe max.{% else %}Max. cutting depth{% endif %}</th><td>{% if lang == "de" %}bis 1.400 mm{% else %}up to 1,400 mm{% endif %}</td></tr>
            <tr><th>{% if lang == "de" %}Fräsbreite{% else %}Cutting width{% endif %}</th><td>60–400 mm</td></tr>
            <tr><th>{% if lang == "de" %}Trägergerät{% else %}Carrier machine{% endif %}</th><td>{% if lang == "de" %}ab 6 t (Mobil- / Kettenbagger){% else %}from 6 t (wheeled / tracked excavator){% endif %}</td></tr>
            <tr><th>{% if lang == "de" %}Antrieb{% else %}Drive{% endif %}</th><td>{% if lang == "de" %}Hydraulisch über Bagger-Hydraulik{% else %}Hydraulic via excavator hydraulics{% endif %}</td></tr>
            <tr><th>{% if lang == "de" %}Anbau{% else %}Attachment{% endif %}</th><td>{% if lang == "de" %}Schnellwechsler-kompatibel{% else %}Quick-coupler compatible{% endif %}</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
