      <div class="heading">
        <span class="section-index">06 / FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Häufige Fragen<br><em class="serif-italic">zu LIBA-Grabenfräsen.</em>{% else %}Frequently Asked Questions<br><em class="serif-italic">about LIBA Trench Cutters.</em>{% endif %}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="aside">
        <p class="lead">{% if lang == "de" %}Alles Wichtige zu Modellen, Einsatzgebieten, Frästiefen und Mietoptionen — direkt beantwortet vom Werk in Lingen.{% else %}Everything you need to know about models, applications, cutting depths and hire options — answered directly from the factory in Lingen.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list reveal">

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>{% if lang == "de" %}Wie tief kann eine Grabenfräse fräsen?{% else %}How deep can a trench cutter cut?{% endif %}<span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">{% if lang == "de" %}Die Frästiefe hängt vom Modell ab. Kompakte Baggeranbau-Fräsen (GM 140 H) erreichen bis zu 900 mm. Schlepperanbau-Modelle wie die GM 180 AF fräsen bis 1.800 mm. Tiefenfräsen wie die GM 300 HF und GM 450 H ermöglichen Arbeiten bis zu 4.500 mm Frästiefe — für anspruchsvollen Sondertiefbau und Fernwärmeprojekte.{% else %}Cutting depth depends on the model. Compact excavator-mounted cutters (GM 140 H) reach up to 900 mm. Tractor-mounted models such as the GM 180 AF cut to 1,800 mm. Deep-cut machines such as the GM 300 HF and GM 450 H enable work to depths of 4,500 mm — for demanding special civil engineering and district heating projects.{% endif %}</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>{% if lang == "de" %}Welche Grabenfräsen gibt es für den Baggeranbau?{% else %}Which trench cutters are available for excavator attachment?{% endif %}<span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">{% if lang == "de" %}LIBA bietet folgende Grabenfräsen als Baggeranbaufräsen an: GM 140 H (ab 6 t, bis 900 mm Frästiefe), GM 140 AFH-500 (bis 500 mm, ab 8 t) und GM 140 AFH-600 (bis 600 mm, ab 12 t). Diese Anbaufräsen werden hydraulisch über die Bagger-Hydraulik angetrieben und sind Schnellwechsler-kompatibel.{% else %}LIBA offers the following trench cutters as excavator attachments: GM 140 H (from 6 t, up to 900 mm cutting depth), GM 140 AFH-500 (up to 500 mm, from 8 t) and GM 140 AFH-600 (up to 600 mm, from 12 t). These attachment cutters are hydraulically driven via the excavator hydraulics and are quick-coupler compatible.{% endif %}</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>{% if lang == "de" %}Welche Grabenfräsen sind für Traktoren und Schlepper geeignet?{% else %}Which trench cutters are suitable for tractors?{% endif %}<span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">{% if lang == "de" %}Als Schlepperanbau-Grabenfräse eignen sich: GM 1 AF, GM 1 AS (bis 400 mm, kompakt), GM 140 AF, GM 160 AF, GM 160 AS (bis 1.200 mm, Mittelklasse) sowie GM 180 AF und GM 600 R (bis 1.800 mm, High-Performance). Die Modellwahl hängt von Frästiefe, Fräsbreite und dem verfügbaren Trägerfahrzeug ab.{% else %}Suitable tractor-mounted trench cutters include: GM 1 AF, GM 1 AS (up to 400 mm, compact), GM 140 AF, GM 160 AF, GM 160 AS (up to 1,200 mm, mid-range) and GM 180 AF and GM 600 R (up to 1,800 mm, high-performance). Model selection depends on cutting depth, cutting width and the available carrier machine.{% endif %}</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>{% if lang == "de" %}Kann eine Grabenfräse in hartem Boden oder Fels eingesetzt werden?{% else %}Can a trench cutter be used in hard ground or rock?{% endif %}<span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">{% if lang == "de" %}Ja. Die selbstfahrende Grabenfräse GM 6 ASR ist speziell für Hartgestein bis Felsklasse IV entwickelt worden. Sie bewährt sich in Kalkstein, Schiefer und Bergbaugebieten und erreicht Frästiefen bis 800 mm in Fels — wirtschaftlich dort, wo Bagger und Trennsäge nicht rentabel sind.{% else %}Yes. The self-propelled GM 6 ASR trench cutter was developed specifically for hard rock up to rock class IV. It performs reliably in limestone, slate and mining environments, reaching cutting depths of up to 800 mm in rock — economically viable where excavators and cut-off saws are not profitable.{% endif %}</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>{% if lang == "de" %}Kann ich bei Lingener Baumaschinen eine Grabenfräse mieten?{% else %}Can I hire a trench cutter from Lingener Baumaschinen?{% endif %}<span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">{% if lang == "de" %}Ja. LIBA bietet Grabenfräsen zur Tages-, Wochen- und Monatsmiete an. Verfügbar sind GM 4 Allrad, GM 4 Raupe und GM 6 ASR — jeweils mit Bedienereinweisung und 24/7-Werkshotline während des Einsatzes. Bis zu 100 % der Mietkosten können beim späteren Kauf angerechnet werden. <a href="/mieten.html" style="color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;">Zur Mietseite</a>{% else %}Yes. LIBA offers trench cutters for daily, weekly and monthly hire. Available models are GM 4 All-Wheel, GM 4 Crawler and GM 6 ASR — each with operator training and 24/7 factory hotline during deployment. Up to 100% of hire costs can be offset against a subsequent purchase. <a href="/en/mieten.html" style="color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;">Go to hire page</a>{% endif %}</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>{% if lang == "de" %}Sind Gebraucht-Grabenfräsen erhältlich?{% else %}Are used trench cutters available?{% endif %}<span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">{% if lang == "de" %}Ja. LIBA verkauft gebrauchte Grabenfräsen direkt aus dem Werk — nach vollständiger Werksinspektion, mit lückenloser Maschinenhistorie und Garantie auf alle im Rahmen der Inspektion getauschten Teile. Kein Zwischenhändler, kein Aufschlag. <a href="/gebrauchtmaschinen.html" style="color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;">Zu den Gebrauchtmaschinen</a>{% else %}Yes. LIBA sells used trench cutters directly from the factory — after a full factory inspection, with a complete machine history and warranty on all parts replaced during inspection. No middlemen, no premium. <a href="/en/gebrauchtmaschinen.html" style="color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;">View used machines</a>{% endif %}</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>{% if lang == "de" %}In welchen Ländern sind LIBA-Grabenfräsen erhältlich?{% else %}In which countries are LIBA trench cutters available?{% endif %}<span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></span></summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">{% if lang == "de" %}Lingener Baumaschinen ist seit 1969 tätig und liefert Grabenfräsen in über 60 Länder weltweit. Vertrieb und Lieferung erfolgen direkt ab Werk Lingen (Ems) — inklusive Tieflader-Transport auf Wunsch. Für internationale Anfragen und Händlerinformationen wenden Sie sich direkt an <a href="/kontakt.html" style="color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;">info@lingener-baumaschinen.de</a>.{% else %}Lingener Baumaschinen has been operating since 1969 and delivers trench cutters to over 60 countries worldwide. Sales and delivery are made direct from the Lingen (Ems) factory — including low-loader transport on request. For international enquiries and dealer information, please contact <a href="/en/kontakt.html" style="color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;">info@lingener-baumaschinen.de</a> directly.{% endif %}</p>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-dark" id="kalkulator">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <div class="heading">
        <span class="section-index is-dark" style="color: var(--brand-light);">{% if lang == "de" %}07 / Kalkulator{% else %}07 / Calculator{% endif %}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">{% if lang == "de" %}Wie viel Trasse<br><em class="serif-italic">schaffen Sie pro Tag?</em>{% else %}How many metres of<br><em class="serif-italic">route can you achieve per day?</em>{% endif %}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="aside">
        <p class="lead">{% if lang == "de" %}Richtwerte auf Basis von Bodenart und Maschinenmodell. Exakte Werte hängen von Konfiguration, Fahrerprofil und Trassengeometrie ab — sprechen Sie uns an.{% else %}Indicative figures based on ground type and machine model. Exact values depend on configuration, operator profile and route geometry — please contact us.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px); padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); max-width: 720px;">
      <div class="grid grid-2" style="gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="k-boden" style="color: var(--canvas); font-weight: 500;">{% if lang == "de" %}Bodenart{% else %}Ground type{% endif %}</label>
          <select id="k-boden" style="margin-top: .5rem; background: var(--steel-900); color: var(--canvas); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.12);">
            <option value="1000">{% if lang == "de" %}Sand / Lockerboden{% else %}Sand / loose ground{% endif %}</option>
            <option value="700" selected>{% if lang == "de" %}Lehmiger Boden{% else %}Loamy ground{% endif %}</option>
            <option value="400">{% if lang == "de" %}Kompakter Lehm / Mergel{% else %}Compact clay / marl{% endif %}</option>
            <option value="200">{% if lang == "de" %}Halbfels / Weichgestein{% else %}Semi-rock / soft stone{% endif %}</option>
            <option value="80">{% if lang == "de" %}Hartgestein / Fels{% else %}Hard rock{% endif %}</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="k-modell" style="color: var(--canvas); font-weight: 500;">{% if lang == "de" %}Maschinenmodell{% else %}Machine model{% endif %}</label>
          <select id="k-modell" style="margin-top: .5rem; background: var(--steel-900); color: var(--canvas); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.12);">
            <option value="1.0">{% if lang == "de" %}GM 4 Raupe / Allrad{% else %}GM 4 Crawler / All-Wheel{% endif %}</option>
            <option value="0.8">{% if lang == "de" %}GM 180 AF (Schlepperanbau){% else %}GM 180 AF (tractor-mounted){% endif %}</option>
            <option value="0.6">{% if lang == "de" %}GM 140 AFH (Baggeranbau){% else %}GM 140 AFH (excavator attachment){% endif %}</option>
            <option value="0.5">{% if lang == "de" %}GM 450 H (Tiefenfräse){% else %}GM 450 H (deep-cut){% endif %}</option>
            <option value="0.15">{% if lang == "de" %}GM 6 ASR (Felsfräse){% else %}GM 6 ASR (rock cutter){% endif %}</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="k-result" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); padding-top: 1.5rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; text-align: center;">
        <div>
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 400; color: var(--brand-light); letter-spacing: -.04em;" id="k-day">0</div>
          <div style="font-size: .8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--steel-400); margin-top: .25rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Meter / Tag{% else %}Metres / Day{% endif %}</div>
          <div style="margin-top: .85rem; height: 4px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.07); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden;">
            <div id="k-bar-day" style="height: 100%; width: 0%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-light)); border-radius: 2px; transition: width .65s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 400; color: var(--canvas); letter-spacing: -.04em;" id="k-week">0</div>
          <div style="font-size: .8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--steel-400); margin-top: .25rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Meter / Woche{% else %}Metres / Week{% endif %}</div>
          <div style="margin-top: .85rem; height: 4px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.07); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden;">
            <div id="k-bar-week" style="height: 100%; width: 0%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.4); border-radius: 2px; transition: width .65s .08s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 400; color: var(--canvas); letter-spacing: -.04em;" id="k-month">0</div>
          <div style="font-size: .8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--steel-400); margin-top: .25rem;">{% if lang == "de" %}Meter / Monat{% else %}Metres / Month{% endif %}</div>
          <div style="margin-top: .85rem; height: 4px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.07); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden;">
            <div id="k-bar-month" style="height: 100%; width: 0%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.4); border-radius: 2px; transition: width .65s .16s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="color: var(--steel-500); font-size: .8rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .02em;">{% if lang == "de" %}Richtwert · Abweichungen ±30 % je nach Konfiguration und Einsatzbedingungen{% else %}Indicative figure · Variations of ±30% depending on configuration and operating conditions{% endif %}</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Kalkulator-Logik liegt in /assets/js/main.js (CSP ohne 'unsafe-inline') -->
  </div>
</section>

